<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  <%= @position.payee.display_name %>'s contracting position "<%= @position.title %>" for
  <%= @event.name %> ends on <strong><%= @position.end_date.to_fs(:long) %></strong>.
</p>

<p>
  After that date, <%= @position.payee.display_name %> will no longer be able to submit
  invoices for this position. If you'd like to continue working with them, please create a
  new contractor position before then.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "View this contractor on HCB", event_payroll_position_url(@event, @position) %>
</p>

<p>
  Sincerely,
  <br><br>
  The HCB Team
</p>
